Package: libmozjs-115-jit-0
Version: 115.12.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
MinimumOSVersion: 14.0.0
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Provides: libmozjs-115-0
Conflicts: libmozjs-115-0
Replaces: libmozjs-115-0
Section: Libraries
Homepage: https://spidermonkey.dev/
Description: JavaScript engine library (SpiderMonkey 115, JIT)
 JIT-enabled SpiderMonkey 115 (ESR), cross-compiled for iOS. Uses the mprotect
 W^X path on devices without APRR (A10) and the pthread_jit fast path on A11+.
 Drop-in replacement for libmozjs-115-0. Pairs with gjs 1.78. Consumers must
 carry the dynamic-codesigning entitlement (see docs/mozjs-jit-plan.md).
